{"generalSituation":"Winds will be weak and the weather will be very hot over the coast of Guangdong today. Showers triggered by high temperatures will affect the region. With a surge of the northeast monsoon affecting southern China, it will be cloudier with a few showers over the region in the next couple of days. A relatively dry replenishment of the northeast monsoon will affect Guangdong early to midweek next week. The weather will improve over the region. It will be slightly cooler in the morning.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20261001","week":"Thursday","forecastWind":"Light winds force 2.","forecastWeather":"Mainly fine. Extremely hot in some areas during the day. Becoming cloudy with a few showers and chance of isolated thunderstorms later.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":34,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":29,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":60,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":90,"PSR":"Medium Low"},{"forecastDate":"20261002","week":"Friday","forecastWind":"East force 3 to 4.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. More showers with thunderstorms in some areas.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":95,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":70,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":63,"PSR":"High"},{"forecastDate":"20261003","week":"Saturday","forecastWind":"East force 3 to 4.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. More showers in some areas at first.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":95,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":70,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":62,"PSR":"Medium"},{"forecastDate":"20261004","week":"Sunday","forecastWind":"East to northeast force 3 to 4.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. Sunny intervals during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":2